<quiz>
    <question type="description">
        <name>
            <text>1.4.1.5 Streichen gemeinsamer Faktoren [Cancelling Common Factors]</text>
        </name>
        <questiontext format="html">
            <text><![CDATA[
<h4 class="HELM_example">
    <span class="multilang" lang="en">
        Example
    </span>
    <span class="multilang" lang="de">
        Beispiel
    </span>
</h4>
<p>
    <span class="multilang" lang="en">
        Simplify \(\dfrac{3x+6}{6x+12}\)
    </span>
    <span class="multilang" lang="de">
        Vereinfachen Sie \(\dfrac{3x+6}{6x+12}\)
    </span>
</p>
<h4 class="HELM_solution">
    <span class="multilang" lang="en">
        Solution
    </span>
    <span class="multilang" lang="de">
        Lösung
    </span>
</h4>
<p>
    <span class="multilang" lang="en">
        First we factorise the numerator and the denominator to see if there are any common factors.
    </span>
    <span class="multilang" lang="de">
        Zunächst faktorisieren wir Zähler und Nenner, um zu sehen, ob es gemeinsame Teiler gibt.
    </span>
</p>
<p>
    \(\qquad \dfrac{3x+6}{6x+12} = \dfrac{3(x+2)}{6(x+2)} = \dfrac{3}{6} = \dfrac{1}{2}\)
</p>
<p>
    <span class="multilang" lang="en">
        The factors \(x + 2\) and 3 have been cancelled.
    </span>
    <span class="multilang" lang="de">
        Die Faktoren \(x + 2\) und 3 wurden gestrichen.
    </span>
</p>
]]></text>
        </questiontext>
        <generalfeedback format="html">
            <text></text>
